      "before": "",
      "after": "<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Body Material:</strong> Suede Upper with A Soft, Textured Finish</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Color:</strong> Navy Blue with Black Accents</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Construction:</strong> Low-Top Silhouette with Multi-Panel Upper Construction</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Detailing:</strong> Rounded Toe, Curved Suede Overlay Panels with Clean Stitching</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Fastening:</strong> Black Lace-Up Closure Covered by an Extended Fold-Over Tongue Flap</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Tongue: </strong>Wide Black Fold-Over Flap Featuring FUROR Branding</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Interior: </strong>Padded Collar and FJ-Branded Insole</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Sole Detailing: </strong>Textured Sidewall and Patterned Outsole for Grip</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<strong>Vibe:</strong> Sporty, Modern, &amp; Distinctive</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Description:</strong><br>A suede sneaker featuring a distinctive black fold-over tongue flap with FUROR branding. The soft-textured upper, curved toe stitching and contrasting detailing create a sporty, modern look, complemented by a matching dark sole.</p>"
